                                "sense_id": "d94f9e11-e295-3e95-b6bc-7e8a538915ed",
                                "text": "Another important circumstance respecting our transcendental esthetics is, that it does not insinuate itself merely as a plausible hypothesis, but is as certain and indubitable as we can require any theory to be in order to serve as an organum."
                            }
                        ]
